  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "World 9 difficulties use direct public level 56, 72, 81 and 90 values; no interpolation is used.",
    "Funereal Kiss deals 400% ATK Physical damage to one target and Sunken Rain deals 250% ATK Physical damage to all opponents.",
    "Harrowing Obituary grants a one-turn 50% damage increase, adds a permanent 12% damage increase per use, and adds one initial hit bar to subsequently summoned Sombrous Sepulchers.",
    "Fading Radiance counts opposing resolved actions and queues Losing Eventide Light against the third actor; Weakness Break clears Sunset and the temporary Obituary increase.",
    "Go Into That Good Night fills allied Energy, applies Weakness Protection, captures the next two acting characters, and queues Watery Dissolution; Weakness Break clears Nightfall and the temporary Obituary increase.",
    "Morbid Dream makes the exact captured formation untargetable and summons a formation-linked Sombrous Sepulcher owned by the boss.",
    "Each Sombrous Sepulcher starts with five hit bars plus permanent Obituary uses; Damage Applied, DoT damage and Weakness Break consume bars through shared events.",
    "Defeating a formation-linked Sombrous Sepulcher restores the corresponding character to Present, removes Morbid Dream, heals 50% maximum HP, and sets Energy to the runtime cap.",
    "The complete capture, linked-unit, fixed-bar, release, queue and Weakness-Break paths use shared Rule IR and enemy lifecycle operations without a native handler."
  ]
